# Original camera and video masters, ~81MB. The optimised copies that the site
# actually ships live in public/visuals/ and ARE committed.
#
# The leading slash matters. A bare "visuals/" matches a directory of that name
# at ANY depth, so it also swallows public/visuals/ — which silently deploys a
# site with no images at all.
/visuals/
